t":"(1) ____ off on trips hoping that we will reach our destination safely and on time.","questionType":"matching","acceptedAnswers":["set"],"options":["commuters","delays","diverted","jam","journeys","landing","motorists","passengers","queue","set"]},{"number":2,"prompt":"(2) ____ that took longer than expected.","questionType":"matching","acceptedAnswers":["journeys"],"options":["commuters","delays","diverted","jam","journeys","landing","motorists","passengers","queue","set"]},{"number":3,"prompt":"(3) ____ on a Manchester to London train had a very late night when their journey took five hours longer than usual. After changing trains once, they were unable to continue because the second train broke down. They had to stand in a","questionType":"matching","acceptedAnswers":["passengers"],"options":["commuters","delays","diverted","jam","journeys","landing","motorists","passengers","queue","set"]},{"number":4,"prompt":"(4) ____ to board a coach. They could have flown to New York in less time than it took to get across England!","questionType":"matching","acceptedAnswers":["queue"],"options":["commuters","delays","diverted","jam","journeys","landing","motorists","passengers","queue","set"]},{"number":5,"prompt":"(5) ____ when flying, but have you ever been late due to singing? A plane travelling from Los Angeles to New York had to make an emergency","questionType":"matching","acceptedAnswers":["delays"],"options":["commuters","delays","diverted","jam","journeys","landing","motorists","passengers","queue","set"]},{"number":6,"prompt":"(6) ____ because a passenger refused to stop singing. The crew decided it","questionType":"matching","acceptedAnswers":["landing"],"options":["commuters","delays","diverted","jam","journeys","landing","motorists","passengers","queue","set"]},{"number":7,"prompt":"(7) ____ to Kansas City where everyone had to wait for another flight. If you think taking the car is always fastest, you might need to reconsider.","questionType":"matching","a